<title>USA: Fonix names Douglas Rex as CFO.</title>
<headline>Fonix names Douglas Rex as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fonix Corp said Tuesday that it appointed Douglas Rex as its chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Fonix is a development-stage company producing automatic speech recognition technologies.</p>
</text>
